Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.31,0:00:33.83,Song,,0,0,0,,{copied from episode 2}{copy any changes I made, if I made any; at this point I don't even know, this was so shit}Let's walk on without looking back through the crowd\NA brand-new story is just beginning
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.83,0:00:45.11,Song,,0,0,0,,I spent those lonely nights with you\NHolding feelings my lips could never say
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.11,0:00:51.15,Song,,0,0,0,,Feeling Heart\NYour eyes that day
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.09,0:00:57.62,Song,,0,0,0,,Reflected the color of the sky
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.62,0:00:59.39,Song,,0,0,0,,Feeling Heart
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.39,0:01:11.49,Song,,0,0,0,,Even if the promise we made hand in hand\Nseems ready to disappear into the headwind...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.34,0:01:18.51,Song,,0,0,0,,Our hearts are always wide open and unbeatable
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.51,0:01:24.89,Song,,0,0,0,,No matter how long the stormy night lasts,\Nit'll soon give way to blue skies
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.89,0:01:39.72,Song,,0,0,0,,See? Our hearts are ultimately unbeatable! \NLet's face the wind with our heads held high
